OL,3,GNEWSANew #25m NHS diagnostics centre
OL,4,Aset for Bilston
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans have been lodged for a
OL,7,Fmulti-million pound Community
OL,8,FDiagnostic Centre (CDC) in Bilston to
OL,9,Fspeed up access to medical tests and
OL,10,Fscans.
OL,12,FThe proposed health and wellbeing unit,
OL,13,Fnext to the WV Active Bilston-Bert
OL,14,FWilliams leisure centre, was chosen as
OL,15,Fthe CDC's new home, subject to approval
OL,16,Ffrom the city council.
OL,18,FIt is aimed at boosting existing
OL,19,Fservices at New Cross Hospital, Cannock
OL,20,FHospital and Walsall Manor Hospital.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
