OL,3,GNEWSANew #25m NHS diagnostics centre
OL,4,Aset for Bilston
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe proposal is to create a hub that
OL,7,Fcombines community diagnostic services,
OL,8,Fprimary care, family support and
OL,9,Fleisure services. The campus will
OL,10,Fimprove health outcomes for people in
OL,11,Fwolverhampton and Walsall said City of
OL,12,FWolverhampton leader, Stephen Simkins.
